<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BULLETIN DE PAIE</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        
        .container {
            width: 210mm;
            height: 297mm;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 15mm;
            background: white;
        }
        
        .header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: flex-start;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .company-info {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .company-logo {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border-radius: 4px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        
        .company-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }
        
        .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        .employee-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
        }

        .detail-section {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .detail-card {
            flex: 1;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .detail-card h4 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .detail-card p {
            margin: 3px 0;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .detail-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 10px;
        }

        .detail-table th,
        .detail-table td {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 5px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .detail-table th {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .info-block {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .info-block h4 {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc;
        }
        
        .info-block p {
            margin: 2px 0;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        
        .info-block strong {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 120px;
        }
        
        .payslip-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }
        
        .payslip-table thead {
            background: #f5f5f5;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
        }
        
        .payslip-table th {
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        
        .payslip-table td {
            padding: 6px 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        
        .payslip-table tr.section-header {
            background: #e8e8e8;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .payslip-table tr.section-header td {
            border-top: 2px solid #000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
        }
        
        .payslip-table tr.total {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border-top: 2px solid #000;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .payslip-table tr.subtotal {
            background: #f9f9f9;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .text-right {
            text-align: right;
        }
        
        .amount {
            text-align: right;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        
        .negative {
            color: #d32f2f;
        }
        
        .summary {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 15px 0;
            border: 2px solid #000;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        
        .summary-item {
            flex: 1;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .summary-label {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .summary-value {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #1976d2;
        }
        
        .footer {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 10px;
            border-top: 1px solid #ddd;
            font-size: 9px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .contributions {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        
        .contributions-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 9px;
        }
        
        .contributions-table thead {
            background: #f5f5f5;
        }
        
        .contributions-table th,
        .contributions-table td {
            padding: 5px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            text-align: right;
        }
        
        .contributions-table th {
            text-align: left;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .contributions-table .label {
            text-align: left;
        }
        
        .page-break {
            page-break-after: always;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- En-tête -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="company-info">
                <div class="company-name">{{company.name}}</div>
                <div style="font-size: 9px;">{{company.address}}</div>
                <div style="font-size: 9px;">{{company.city}}</div>
                <div style="font-size: 9px;">{{company.phone}}</div>
                <div style="font-size: 9px;">{{company.email}}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right; font-size: 9px;">
                <div><strong>Bulletin de Paie N°:</strong> {{payslip.payslipNumber}}</div>
                <div><strong>Exécution paie:</strong> {{payslip.payrollRunNumber}} / {{payslip.payrollRunStatus}}</div>
                <div><strong>Période:</strong> {{formatDate payroll.startDate}} - {{formatDate payroll.endDate}}</div>
                <div><strong>Mois:</strong> {{payroll.month}} / {{payroll.year}} - {{payroll.type}}</div>
                <div><strong>Date de génération:</strong> {{today}}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="title">BULLETIN DE PAIE</div>
        
        <!-- Informations employé -->
        <div class="employee-info">
            <div class="info-block">
                <h4>Informations Employé</h4>
                <p><strong>Nom & Prénom:</strong> {{employee.firstName}} {{employee.lastName}}</p>
                <p><strong>Matricule:</strong> {{employee.employeeCode}}</p>
                <p><strong>CIN:</strong> {{employee.cin}}</p>
                <p><strong>N° CNSS:</strong> {{employee.cnssNumber}}</p>
                <p><strong>Identifiant Fiscal:</strong> {{employee.taxIdentifier}}</p>
                <p><strong>Fonction:</strong> {{employee.position}}</p>
                <p><strong>Adresse:</strong> {{employee.address}}</p>
                <p><strong>Ville:</strong> {{employee.city}}</p>
                <p><strong>Mail:</strong> {{employee.email}}</p>
                <p><strong>Téléphone:</strong> {{employee.phone}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="info-block">
                <h4>Contrat et Paiement</h4>
                <p><strong>Type de Contrat:</strong> {{contract.type}}</p>
                <p><strong>Statut Contrat:</strong> {{contract.status}}</p>
                <p><strong>Type de calcul:</strong> {{contract.salaryCalculationType}}</p>
                <p><strong>Date de Début:</strong> {{formatDate contract.startDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Date de Fin:</strong> {{formatDate contract.endDate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Salaire de base:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.baseSalary}}</p>
                <p><strong>Base taux:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.baseRate}}</p>
                <p><strong>Heures / mois:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.hoursPerMonth}}</p>
                <p><strong>Jours / mois:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.workingDaysPerMonth}}</p>
                <p><strong>Salaire déclaré CNSS:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.cnssDeclaredSalary}}</p>
                <p><strong>Transport:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.transportAllowance}}</p>
                <p><strong>Représentation:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.representationAllowance}}</p>
                <p><strong>Ancienneté:</strong> {{formatMoney contract.seniorityAllowance}}</p>
                <p><strong>Mode de paiement:</strong> {{employee.paymentMode}}</p>
                <p><strong>Banque:</strong> {{employee.bankName}}</p>
                <p><strong>Compte:</strong> {{employee.bankAccountNumber}}</p>
                {{#if contract.notes}}
                <p><strong>Notes Contrat:</strong> {{contract.notes}}</p>
                {{/if}}
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#if recurringItems.length}}
        <div class="detail-section">
            <div class="detail-card">
                <h4>Éléments récurrents</h4>
                <table class="detail-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Libellé</th>
                            <th>Taux</th>
                            <th>Montant</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {{#each recurringItems}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.rate}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.amount}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/each}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if variableItems.length}}
        <div class="detail-section">
            <div class="detail-card">
                <h4>Éléments variables</h4>
                <table class="detail-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Libellé</th>
                            <th>Taux / Qté</th>
                            <th>Montant</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {{#each variableItems}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                            <td>{{#if this.quantity}}{{this.quantity}} × {{formatMoney this.rate}}{{else}}{{formatMoney this.rate}}{{/if}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.amount}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/each}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if statutoryRates.length}}
        <div class="detail-section">
            <div class="detail-card">
                <h4>Taux statutaires</h4>
                <table class="detail-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Libellé</th>
                            <th>Taux</th>
                            <th>Plafond</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {{#each statutoryRates}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.rate}}</td>
                            <td>{{#if this.ceilingAmount}}{{formatMoney this.ceilingAmount}}{{else}}—{{/if}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/each}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-card">
                <h4>Barème IR</h4>
                <table class="detail-table">
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th>Tranche</th>
                            <th>Taux</th>
                            <th>Déduction</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        {{#each taxBrackets}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.min}} - {{#if this.max}}{{formatMoney this.max}}{{else}}∞{{/if}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.rate}}</td>
                            <td>{{formatMoney this.deduction}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        {{/each}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/if}}

        <!-- Tableau des éléments de paie -->
        <table class="payslip-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th style="width: 50%">Désignation</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: center">Nombre</th>
                    <th style="width: 15%; text-align: right">Taux</th>
                    <th style="width: 20%; text-align: right">Montants</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#each items}}
                    {{#ifEquals this.category "GAINS"}}
                        <tr>
                            <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                            <td class="text-right">{{this.quantity}}</td>
                            <td class="amount">{{formatMoney this.rate}}</td>
                            <td class="amount">{{formatMoney this.amount}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    {{/ifEquals}}
                {{/each}}
                
                <tr class="subtotal">
                    <td colspan="3">SALAIRE BRUT</td>
                    <td class="amount">{{formatMoney payslip.grossSalary}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{#if payslip.taxableGross}}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="3">SALAIRE IMPOSABLE</td>
                    <td class="amount">{{formatMoney payslip.taxableGross}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if payslip.totalAllowances}}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="3">TOTAL ALLOCATIONS</td>
                    <td class="amount">{{formatMoney payslip.totalAllowances}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/if}}
                {{#if payslip.totalBonuses}}
                <tr>
                    <td colspan="3">TOTAL PRIMES</td>
                    <td class="amount">{{formatMoney payslip.totalBonuses}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/if}}
                
                <tr class="section-header">
                    <td colspan="4">COTISATIONS SALARIALES</td>
                </tr>
                
                {{#each contributions}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                        <td class="text-right">{{formatMoney this.baseAmount}}</td>
                        <td class="amount">{{multiply this.rate 100}}%</td>
                        <td class="amount negative">- {{formatMoney this.employeeAmount}}</td>
                    </tr>
                {{/each}}
                
                <tr class="subtotal">
                    <td colspan="3">TOTAL COTISATIONS</td>
                    <td class="amount negative">- {{formatMoney payslip.employeeChargesTotal}}</td>
                </tr>
                
                <tr class="section-header">
                    <td colspan="4">IMPÔTS</td>
                </tr>
                
                <tr>
                    <td>Impôt sur le Revenu (IR)</td>
                    <td colspan="2" class="text-right">Base: {{formatMoney payslip.incomeTaxBase}}</td>
                    <td class="amount negative">- {{formatMoney payslip.incomeTaxAmount}}</td>
                </tr>
                
                {{#if payslip.totalAdvances}}
                <tr class="section-header">
                    <td colspan="4">AVANCES ET RETENUES</td>
                </tr>
                
                {{#each deductions}}
                    <tr>
                        <td>{{this.label}}</td>
                        <td colspan="2"></td>
                        <td class="amount negative">- {{formatMoney this.amount}}</td>
                    </tr>
                {{/each}}
                {{/if}}
                
                <tr class="total">
                    <td colspan="3">SALAIRE NET À PAYER</td>
                    <td class="amount">{{formatMoney payslip.netSalary}}</td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
        
        <!-- Résumé explicite -->
        <div class="summary">
            <div class="summary-item">
                <div class="summary-label">Salaire Brut</div>
                <div class="summary-value">{{formatMoney payslip.grossSalary}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <div class="summary-label">IR</div>
                <div class="summary-value negative">- {{formatMoney payslip.incomeTaxAmount}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <div class="summary-label">Cotisations</div>
                <div class="summary-value negative">- {{formatMoney payslip.employeeChargesTotal}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <div class="summary-label">Avances / Retenues</div>
                <div class="summary-value negative">- {{formatMoney payslip.totalAdvances}}</div>
            </div>
            <div class="summary-item">
                <div class="summary-label">Net à Payer</div>
                <div class="summary-value">{{formatMoney payslip.netSalary}}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Tableau des cotisations détaillées -->
        <div class="contributions">
            <h4 style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;">DÉTAIL DES COTISATIONS PATRONALES</h4>
            <table class="contributions-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="label">Libellé</th>
                        <th>Base</th>
                        <th>Taux</th>
                        <th>Salarié</th>
                        <th>Employeur</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    {{#each contributions}}
                    <tr>
                        <td class="label">{{this.label}}</td>
                        <td>{{formatMoney this.baseAmount}}</td>
                        <td>{{multiply this.rate 100}}%</td>
                        <td>{{formatMoney this.employeeAmount}}</td>
                        <td>{{formatMoney this.employerAmount}}</td>
                    </tr>
                    {{/each}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Pied de page -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Ce bulletin de paie est établi conformément à la législation fiscale et sociale en vigueur.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 5px; font-size: 8px;">Généré le {{today}} - {{company.name}}</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
